menu "Web UI"

    config WEB_UI_SETTINGS_FROM_NETWORK
        bool "Allow changing the cloud and gateway settings from the network (development only)"
        default n
        depends on !SECURE_BOOT && !SECURE_FLASH_ENC_ENABLED
        help
            Makes the cloud and gateway settings of the setup page (AWS IoT endpoint, thing name, certificate,
            device key, hostname, hotspot password) available from the regular network, without the setup
            button and the setup hotspot. Handy on a development board to swap certificates, sdkconfig.dev
            turns it on.

            Never install such a build: anyone on the gateway's network could point it at their own AWS IoT
            account and send it commands, including the one that opens the door. Release builds leave it off,
            and it is not available together with secure boot or flash encryption.

endmenu
